### Risk Mitigation Strategy

#### High-Risk Stories (Extra Review Required)
1. **#001** - Type definitions affect entire codebase
2. **#002** - State machine is critical infrastructure
3. **#004** - Race conditions are subtle and hard to test

**Mitigation**:
- Pair programming for #001 and #002
- Extensive integration testing for #004
- Security review for all high-risk stories

#### Medium-Risk Stories (Standard Review)
- All security stories (#005, #006, #007)
- Complex features (#008, #009, #010, #017)

**Mitigation**:
- Code review by senior developer
- Comprehensive test coverage
- Staging deployment testing

#### Low-Risk Stories (Fast Track)
- UI enhancements (#011, #012)
- Optional features (#013, #014, #015, #016)
- Documentation (#018)

**Mitigation**:
- Standard code review
- Unit tests sufficient

